OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming confined to the north and
OL,7,Fwest overnight. Becoming mainly dry
OL,8,Facross the east with clear periods.
OL,9,FChilly in sheltered glens in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FStarting dry across the east.
OL,12,FOtherwise variable amounts of cloud
OL,13,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,14,Facross the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,17,Fspells and fewer showers on Saturday.
OL,18,FMainly dry on Sunday, a few showers in
OL,19,Fthe north. Rain likely to spread
OL,20,Fnortheast on Monday.
